st  like us as a small family business they  depend on that income so it's been more  changing perhaps the smaller locations  compared to the more established ones as  the wall begins to recover from the  pandemic couples families and businesses  are hopeful that they will be able to  celebrate love in the not-too-distant  future it may not be what they had  originally hopeful all planned but maybe  just maybe it could be even better 2020  is definitely going to be possibly the  hardest year for the wedding industry  ever 2021 I hope is gonna be the  greatest year for the wedding industry  ever although we work on so many events  you remember every specific one every  couple and you do you do know them for  the rest of your life so it's a really  nice thing to see them happy especially  after the pandemic as well to think you  know one day they'll be able to tell  your kids you won't believe what happens  mom and dad's wedding it got postponed  because of this crazy pandemic that took  place and it'll make it I think even  more memorable  [Music]
 

